  "statuteText": "281-A:3-a Incarceration of Certain Persons. –\n\nNotwithstanding any provision of law to the contrary, an employee who has become incarcerated pursuant to a conviction shall forfeit any right to workers' compensation indemnity benefits 30 days after incarceration for the remaining period of incarceration."
